@chapter Objective-C Frontend Language Reference
@cindex Objective-C frontend
@cindex frontend, Objective-C

This chapter provides a comprehensive reference for the Objective-C frontend language as
implemented in the EightBol compiler. The frontend consists of a lexer and parser that
tokenize and parse a subset of Objective-C source code into an intermediate representation
suitable for code generation on 8-bit and 16-bit systems.

The frontend is specifically designed for retro game development, mapping Objective-C
constructs to EightBol primitives while respecting the constraints of limited-memory
systems.

